WEBVTT

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:39.012
We've come to arrest you, Your Highness.

00:01:39.012 --> 00:01:40.912
To arrest me?

00:01:44.718 --> 00:01:48.054
Ah, you must be joking.
What are the charges anyway?

00:01:48.054 --> 00:01:50.215
You are charged with
high treason, Your Highness.

00:01:53.026 --> 00:01:54.721
Tenchi!

00:01:56.997 --> 00:01:58.760
Oh!

00:02:07.274 --> 00:02:09.674
Ryo-Ohki, let's get out of here at top speed!

00:02:27.727 --> 00:02:30.964
Do you think they successfully escaped?

00:02:30.964 --> 00:02:32.955
I sure hope they did.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.503
But they had to deal
with Jurai's military, so...

00:02:36.503 --> 00:02:42.676
I wonder what happened on the
Planet Jurai while we were on Earth.

00:02:42.676 --> 00:02:47.306
Well, we may be able to find out
when we get to headquarters.

00:03:05.765 --> 00:03:08.034
It's been a long time.

00:03:08.034 --> 00:03:11.595
Uh-huh. Finally I'm back!

00:03:15.475 --> 00:03:19.179
Headquarters is full of life, isn't it?

00:03:19.179 --> 00:03:21.882
Yup! It makes me feel energetic, too.

00:03:21.882 --> 00:03:27.087
Well, I'll have to pay a
visit to the detective sergeant

00:03:27.087 --> 00:03:29.689
so why don't you get a bite in the cafeteria?

00:03:29.689 --> 00:03:31.589
Okay!

00:03:39.766 --> 00:03:44.137
Kiyone? Kiyone, is that really you?!

00:03:44.137 --> 00:03:45.661
Mitsuki!

00:03:46.106 --> 00:03:47.641
Long time no see.

00:03:47.641 --> 00:03:50.911
I heard that you were coming
back, but did you just get here?

00:03:50.911 --> 00:03:52.012
Yeah, just a moment ago.

00:03:52.012 --> 00:03:54.581
You're looking good.
I'm glad to see you back here.

00:03:54.581 --> 00:03:55.916
Thanks.

00:03:55.916 --> 00:03:59.753
I'm glad you made it back to headquarters.

00:03:59.753 --> 00:04:02.022
Since you were demoted
to such a remote area,

00:04:02.022 --> 00:04:05.559
we all thought that
was the end of your career.

00:04:05.559 --> 00:04:07.260
Oh, really?

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.829
Say, do you remember
our contemporary Niwase?

00:04:09.829 --> 00:04:11.898
Sure, I remember him.

00:04:11.898 --> 00:04:14.167
He is now Chief of the
Public Safety Division, you know.

00:04:14.167 --> 00:04:14.901
Really?

00:04:14.901 --> 00:04:19.573
And Achi? She's Marshal of the
Sirius Branch. Can you believe it?

00:04:19.573 --> 00:04:22.208
So everybody's getting promoted, huh?

00:04:22.208 --> 00:04:24.267
You could say that.

00:04:24.878 --> 00:04:28.415
By the way, I'm in the
Special Investigation Unit now.

00:04:28.415 --> 00:04:31.751
Special Investigation Unit?
Wow! Congratulations.

00:04:31.751 --> 00:04:33.253
It's merely a stepping stone for me.

00:04:33.253 --> 00:04:36.222
Which section are you assigned to?

00:04:36.222 --> 00:04:37.757
Investigation Unit 9, but...

00:04:37.757 --> 00:04:39.059
Unit 9?

00:04:39.059 --> 00:04:43.063
Oh, the one dealing with
minor incidental jobs, huh?

00:04:43.063 --> 00:04:46.166
Good for you. You'll
have plenty of time to relax.

00:04:46.166 --> 00:04:48.498
Ah, I'd better be going.
I have pressing work to do.

00:04:49.669 --> 00:04:51.271
Kiyone.

00:04:51.271 --> 00:04:52.795
I'll see you around.

00:04:56.977 --> 00:04:59.946
What a nasty bitch!

00:05:03.617 --> 00:05:05.141
Excuse me, Sir.

00:05:08.788 --> 00:05:11.324
Detective First Class Kiyone reporting for duty

00:05:11.324 --> 00:05:15.090
to the Criminal Investigation
Unit 9 at headquarters as of today.

00:05:16.463 --> 00:05:18.727
We've been waiting for your arrival.

00:05:21.968 --> 00:05:26.072
I've heard a lot about you, since
you were in the Police Academy.

00:05:26.072 --> 00:05:30.710
I always thought you were too good to
be a resident officer in a remote region.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.045
It's very nice of you to say that.

00:05:32.045 --> 00:05:35.715
Now that you are here I expect to
see you perform up to your ability.

00:05:35.715 --> 00:05:37.342
Yes, Sir!

00:05:38.518 --> 00:05:42.822
Kiyone, it has come to my attention
that you were with the Princess Ayeka

00:05:42.822 --> 00:05:45.759
of the Planet Jurai while you were on Earth.

00:05:45.759 --> 00:05:48.361
Yes, by a strange turn of events.

00:05:48.361 --> 00:05:51.798
I thought I'd already
explained all that in my report.

00:05:51.798 --> 00:05:58.304
Right now, the Galaxy Police
are searching for Princess Ayeka.

00:05:58.304 --> 00:06:01.671
I thought you may have
some idea as to her whereabouts.

00:06:04.044 --> 00:06:06.980
The gentleman over there
must be from Jurai's embassy

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:09.847
or the Intelligence Bureau, maybe?

00:06:13.219 --> 00:06:15.983
Hmm. You are good.

00:06:21.628 --> 00:06:23.630
Mmm! This is good!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:27.333
The Galactic Network
interrupts its regular programs

00:06:27.333 --> 00:06:30.570
for an emergency broadcast regarding
breaking news from the Planet Jurai.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:35.442
As we already informed you, the
Planet Jurai already has a new emperor

00:06:35.442 --> 00:06:38.044
officially approved by the Planetary Council.

00:06:38.044 --> 00:06:39.913
What?!

00:06:39.913 --> 00:06:42.782
This cannot be happening!
I do not believe this!

00:06:42.782 --> 00:06:45.085
Shut up, Ayeka! We can't hear the news!

00:06:45.085 --> 00:06:47.787
Ayeka, please be quiet.

00:06:47.787 --> 00:06:51.691
The throne had been temporarily vacant
pending marriage by the Princess Ayeka.

00:06:51.691 --> 00:06:55.862
The sudden ascendance of a new
emperor has caused some confusion,

00:06:55.862 --> 00:06:58.998
but backed by the new emperor
Yosho, the Jurai government announced

00:06:58.998 --> 00:07:00.488
that they will have everything under control.

00:07:02.736 --> 00:07:04.871
Yosho?

00:07:04.871 --> 00:07:06.372
How could it be?

00:07:06.372 --> 00:07:08.575
It is impossible.

00:07:08.575 --> 00:07:09.709
Yosho?

00:07:09.709 --> 00:07:12.779
Yes, that's the name of Jurai's new emperor.

00:07:12.779 --> 00:07:18.852
I don't remember having seen that
name among the successors to the throne.

00:07:18.852 --> 00:07:21.054
K-Kiyone!

00:07:21.054 --> 00:07:23.215
That's quite all right.

00:07:24.924 --> 00:07:29.429
You may not have heard of him,
but Yosho is the legitimate successor

00:07:29.429 --> 00:07:32.023
of Jurai's royal family
and a legendary warrior.

00:07:32.866 --> 00:07:36.836
He came back to the Planet Jurai.

00:07:36.836 --> 00:07:40.440
L-I just cannot believe any of this!

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:41.930
Ayeka!

00:07:43.443 --> 00:07:45.912
The legendary warrior Yosho,

00:07:45.912 --> 00:07:50.450
I have heard that name
many times, since my childhood.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:54.687
The legendary warrior... Who is he anyway?

00:07:54.687 --> 00:07:57.991
He is said to be the best swordsman
in the empire and he is a noble prince

00:07:57.991 --> 00:07:59.959
gifted with both intelligence and courage.

00:07:59.959 --> 00:08:07.100
But he gave up his position as
the successor and just disappeared.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:10.433
That was many decades ago.

00:08:15.074 --> 00:08:19.045
I do not understand why
he suddenly came forward.

00:08:19.045 --> 00:08:21.414
He must be a fake!

00:08:21.414 --> 00:08:23.449
It's an old trick of many con men!

00:08:23.449 --> 00:08:26.019
Can't be.

00:08:26.019 --> 00:08:30.523
At least he is a royal
family member. That's for sure.

00:08:30.523 --> 00:08:32.252
Why do you say that?

00:08:34.093 --> 00:08:36.095
Because of "Jurai's Power."

00:08:36.095 --> 00:08:41.367
It's because of the power only
Jurai's royal family members possess.

00:08:41.367 --> 00:08:45.071
"Jurai's Power" is said to
even surpass the power of a god!

00:08:45.071 --> 00:08:49.475
Without a demonstration
of this awesome power,

00:08:49.475 --> 00:08:53.639
the Council wouldn't have
approved the enthronement.

00:08:56.149 --> 00:08:59.448
Besides, I saw it with my own eyes.

00:09:00.453 --> 00:09:03.513
I witnessed how powerful Yosho was.

00:09:05.992 --> 00:09:08.228
Dissatisfied with the enthronement of Yosho,

00:09:08.228 --> 00:09:13.900
Princess Ayeka attempted a
<i>coup</i> and is now a fugitive on the run.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.134
<i>Coup d'état?!</i>

00:09:15.134 --> 00:09:16.803
Me?!

00:09:16.803 --> 00:09:19.572
You are so bad, Ayeka.

00:09:19.572 --> 00:09:22.575
You didn't have to do that just
because you didn't make it to the throne.

00:09:22.575 --> 00:09:25.378
Hey, you!

00:09:25.378 --> 00:09:28.114
Hey, that's what it said on TV...

00:09:28.114 --> 00:09:28.781
What?!

00:09:28.781 --> 00:09:31.384
This is a picture of
the space pirate Ryoko

00:09:31.384 --> 00:09:33.786
who is acting together with Princess Ayeka.

00:09:33.786 --> 00:09:36.823
Ryoko has been a most wanted
criminal quite some time now,

00:09:36.823 --> 00:09:41.227
and it is believed that she played
a major part in the attempted <i>coup.</i>

00:09:41.227 --> 00:09:44.898
Why would I wanna help
Ayeka with her conspiracy?

00:09:44.898 --> 00:09:49.435
Look! Because of you,
even I look like a criminal.

00:09:49.435 --> 00:09:53.201
What?! You're the one
who's getting me into trouble.

00:09:53.773 --> 00:09:58.044
Princess Sasami and others that
were involved in this attempted <i>coup</i>

00:09:58.044 --> 00:10:01.481
are still at large along with Princess Ayeka...

00:10:01.481 --> 00:10:05.508
- The station will be continuing its investigation.
- Uh-oh. I'd better tell Kiyone about this news.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.288
Big news! Big news!

00:10:26.839 --> 00:10:29.672
Ayeka, you are being framed.

00:10:30.777 --> 00:10:36.049
I ask you again, where is
Princess Ayeka? You really have no idea?

00:10:36.049 --> 00:10:37.778
I don't know, Sir.

00:10:39.152 --> 00:10:41.120
Very well.

00:10:52.598 --> 00:10:56.796
I must act with a lot of caution now.

00:11:01.741 --> 00:11:04.978
She honestly didn't know, did she?

00:11:04.978 --> 00:11:06.713
She didn't...

00:11:06.713 --> 00:11:12.085
...but we better keep
our eyes on her for a while.

00:11:12.085 --> 00:11:14.110
I agree.

00:11:20.793 --> 00:11:22.283
Mihoshi?

00:11:23.029 --> 00:11:26.132
Please don't forget our request.

00:11:26.132 --> 00:11:27.667
Don't worry about it.

00:11:27.667 --> 00:11:31.471
As soon as Ayeka falls into our
trap we'll hand her over to you.

00:11:31.471 --> 00:11:35.041
We'd like to keep on good terms
with the Planet Jurai, you know.

00:11:35.041 --> 00:11:40.179
Yosho is expecting... remember that.

00:11:40.179 --> 00:11:43.082
Whoa! Who are you?

00:11:43.082 --> 00:11:44.584
How long have you been here?

00:11:44.584 --> 00:11:51.924
Well, I came looking for Kiyone,
but since she's not here... Ha ha!

00:11:51.924 --> 00:11:53.659
Where is Mihoshi?

00:11:53.659 --> 00:11:56.150
Where could she be wandering around?

00:11:56.729 --> 00:11:59.032
Did you hear our conversation?

00:11:59.032 --> 00:12:06.539
Oh, no. I didn't hear anything about
Yosho or anything about Ayeka either.

00:12:06.539 --> 00:12:11.711
I didn't hear a thing, really.

00:12:11.711 --> 00:12:15.203
I think I should be going!

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:19.018
W-Who was that?

00:12:19.018 --> 00:12:20.713
I think she is...

00:12:22.588 --> 00:12:27.193
Yes. She is Detective First Class
Mihoshi, who was Kiyone's partner!

00:12:27.193 --> 00:12:29.228
What?! Capture her immediately!

00:12:29.228 --> 00:12:32.197
Yes, Sir! Emergency dispositions!

00:12:33.866 --> 00:12:35.595
What is going on?

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.618
What is this?

00:13:04.197 --> 00:13:05.531
Kiyone!

00:13:05.531 --> 00:13:07.633
You are completely surrounded.

00:13:07.633 --> 00:13:10.436
Put down your weapon and surrender.

00:13:10.436 --> 00:13:13.706
Mitsuki? What in the world is this?

00:13:13.706 --> 00:13:16.342
You're under arrest, Detective Kiyone.

00:13:16.342 --> 00:13:19.212
Under arrest? Is this a practical joke or what?

00:13:19.212 --> 00:13:22.715
I'm sorry, but this isn't a joke.

00:13:22.715 --> 00:13:24.450
Ah, please don't move.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.853
I've been ordered to
shoot you down if you resist.

00:13:26.853 --> 00:13:28.087
Mitsuki, are you out of your mind?!

00:13:28.087 --> 00:13:30.817
What can I say? It's an order.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.063
As you can see, there's
no way you can escape.

00:13:37.063 --> 00:13:42.235
I don't know what you did to deserve
this, but you must have been desperate.

00:13:42.235 --> 00:13:45.905
You should have come
to me if you had troubles.

00:13:45.905 --> 00:13:48.474
I can't help you with
financial problems, but...

00:13:48.474 --> 00:13:49.942
Freeze, Kiyone!

00:13:49.942 --> 00:13:53.546
Didn't I tell you not to move?

00:13:53.546 --> 00:13:56.481
Please put down your weapons quickly.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.686
You must have some more.

00:14:09.362 --> 00:14:11.898
Don't you think this is rather dramatic?

00:14:11.898 --> 00:14:16.102
It turns out that I'm arresting my classmate.

00:14:16.102 --> 00:14:18.604
Don't take it personally though.

00:14:18.604 --> 00:14:21.095
This isn't easy for me, you know.

00:14:23.976 --> 00:14:26.501
Kiyone, get on! Quickly!

00:14:45.831 --> 00:14:47.700
Thank you, Mihoshi.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.668
I owe you one.

00:14:48.668 --> 00:14:50.727
Let's get out of here!

00:15:15.861 --> 00:15:18.631
You always attract trouble, don't you?

00:15:18.631 --> 00:15:20.399
I thought this was your doing.

00:15:20.399 --> 00:15:24.370
Besides, you're the longtime wanted criminal!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:28.708
Oh, yeah. I didn't think Jurai's
military was also after me, though.

00:15:28.708 --> 00:15:30.576
You traitor.

00:15:30.576 --> 00:15:32.545
Are you calling me a traitor?

00:15:32.545 --> 00:15:35.581
Stop, both of you.
This is no time to be arguing.

00:15:35.581 --> 00:15:39.318
Hmm. We are now criminals everywhere.

00:15:39.318 --> 00:15:42.955
There's no place for us
to hide in this Universe.

00:15:42.955 --> 00:15:45.583
What are we going to do now?

00:15:48.995 --> 00:15:52.131
I guess we'll just have
to go to the Planet Jurai.

00:15:52.131 --> 00:15:54.166
Grandpa!

00:15:54.166 --> 00:15:59.472
I don't know who Yosho is,
but I can't think of any other way

00:15:59.472 --> 00:16:03.776
to straighten things out
and prove our innocence.

00:16:03.776 --> 00:16:05.641
Don't you think so, Ayeka?

00:16:08.114 --> 00:16:09.672
Yes!

00:16:14.787 --> 00:16:16.618
What is the matter, Ryo-Ohki?

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:19.458
Damn!

00:16:19.458 --> 00:16:21.517
Galaxy Police.

00:16:23.162 --> 00:16:25.965
It was all because of you, Mihoshi?!

00:16:25.965 --> 00:16:31.103
I came to rescue you, didn't I?

00:16:31.103 --> 00:16:33.333
You just don't get it, do you? Huh?

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:38.244
Informing all patrolling ships...
Informing all patrolling ships...

00:16:38.244 --> 00:16:42.214
We've spotted the suspect Ayeka
and her group in space zone 247.

00:16:42.214 --> 00:16:43.716
Rush to the scene at once!

00:16:43.716 --> 00:16:48.949
Repeat: We've spotted Ayeka
and her group in space zone 247!

00:17:13.813 --> 00:17:16.082
Damn! Ryo-Ohki is
already running out of power.

00:17:16.082 --> 00:17:16.916
What?!

00:17:16.916 --> 00:17:19.350
Come on, Ryo-Ohki! You can do it!

00:17:27.159 --> 00:17:30.396
We're totally surrounded.

00:17:30.396 --> 00:17:31.597
There's no way out.

00:17:31.597 --> 00:17:33.265
No way out?

00:17:33.265 --> 00:17:35.067
What are we gonna do?

00:17:35.067 --> 00:17:36.898
We don't seem to have much of a choice.

00:17:50.516 --> 00:17:51.983
Will we collide?

00:17:55.154 --> 00:17:56.849
Yes... we will collide.

00:18:05.364 --> 00:18:07.264
What's going on?

00:18:10.703 --> 00:18:12.967
Look! It's Yagami!

00:18:15.841 --> 00:18:17.076
Here come some more!

00:18:17.076 --> 00:18:18.778
Huh?

00:18:18.778 --> 00:18:20.679
They are so persistent.

00:18:20.679 --> 00:18:23.477
We're gonna fire another one.

00:18:37.229 --> 00:18:39.064
You should take advantage now.

00:18:39.064 --> 00:18:40.622
Thanks.

00:19:08.294 --> 00:19:14.667
As you may all know we have captured most
of the main claimants to the throne already,

00:19:14.667 --> 00:19:18.604
but everything is in vain
unless we capture Princess Ayeka,

00:19:18.604 --> 00:19:21.140
who is first in line to the throne.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:25.010
Listen up. We can't fail in this mission.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:28.948
This is a supreme order from Emperor Yosho.

00:19:28.948 --> 00:19:32.384
Long live the new emperor of the Planet Jurai!

00:19:47.132 --> 00:19:48.801
We have discovered two
new members of the conspiracy

00:19:48.801 --> 00:19:51.003
involved in the <i>coup</i> with Princess Ayeka.

00:19:51.003 --> 00:19:53.939
They are Detectives First
Class Kiyone and Mihoshi.

00:19:53.939 --> 00:19:57.443
They are both in active service,
but they are said to have escaped

00:19:57.443 --> 00:20:02.515
from Galaxy Police headquarters in
order to join the rest of their group.

00:20:02.515 --> 00:20:04.783
The Galaxy Police were
rather upset and embarrassed

00:20:04.783 --> 00:20:07.152
by the misconduct of the two active officers.

00:20:07.152 --> 00:20:13.392
I not only have to kiss my promotion
good-bye, but now I am a wanted criminal!

00:20:13.392 --> 00:20:16.328
What's gonna happen to my life?

00:20:16.328 --> 00:20:18.664
Cheer up, Kiyone.

00:20:18.664 --> 00:20:21.867
We can all be together again, right?

00:20:21.867 --> 00:20:26.872
Everything will work out
once we get to the Planet Jurai.

00:20:26.872 --> 00:20:30.075
Mihoshi, you are my bad luck charm.

00:20:30.075 --> 00:20:32.011
Excuse us.

00:20:32.011 --> 00:20:33.779
Sorry to trouble you like this.

00:20:33.779 --> 00:20:37.049
Please escort us to the Planet Jurai.

00:20:37.049 --> 00:20:39.984
Ryo-Ohki, are you all right?

00:20:42.021 --> 00:20:46.559
OK, we're gonna cross the
Galaxy all the way to the Planet Jurai!

00:20:46.559 --> 00:20:49.361
Ryoko, you've got some kind of
nerve drinking at a time like this!

00:20:49.361 --> 00:20:53.465
I see the no smoking sign, but I don't
see a no drinking sign around here.

00:20:53.465 --> 00:20:55.267
You are just a drunkard.

00:20:55.267 --> 00:20:56.502
What's your problem?

00:20:56.502 --> 00:20:57.970
Hey, shut up!

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:01.736
Come on now. Let's try
to get along, shall we?

00:21:02.875 --> 00:21:05.708
What's gonna happen to my life?

00:22:54.687 --> 00:22:57.256
Even the Goddess of Justice,
who is supposed to be fair and just,

00:22:57.256 --> 00:22:58.624
can be blinded sometimes.

00:22:58.624 --> 00:23:05.898
Marked by conspiracy as a wanted criminal,
Princess Ayeka heads home for Planet Jurai.

00:23:05.898 --> 00:23:08.701
While on the run, she has to
disguise herself as a bar owner

00:23:08.701 --> 00:23:15.607
scamming businessmen working
in space to survive day by day.

00:23:15.607 --> 00:23:18.177
Next episode is: "No Need for Hiding!"

00:23:18.177 --> 00:23:20.312
I wonder if we should be doing this.

00:23:20.312 --> 00:23:22.940
It's unquestionably sexy!
